  _landmarkId: truva-antik-kenti
  _displayTitle: Truva Antik Kenti
  _shortDescription: "Truva, yakla\u015F\u0131k 4 bin y\u0131ll\u0131k yerle\u015Fim
    katmanlar\u0131yla Anadolu ve Akdeniz uygarl\u0131klar\u0131 aras\u0131ndaki
    erken temaslar\u0131 g\xF6steren en \xF6nemli arkeolojik alanlardan biridir.
    Homeros\u2019un \u0130lyada destan\u0131ndaki Troya Sava\u015F\u0131 anlat\u0131s\u0131,
    kenti d\xFCnya k\xFClt\xFCr\xFCn\xFCn en g\xFC\xE7l\xFC efsanelerinden biri h\xE2line
    getirmi\u015Ftir. UNESCO D\xFCnya Miras\u0131 olan alandaki \xFCst \xFCste kurulmu\u015F
    kent katmanlar\u0131, binlerce y\u0131ll\u0131k de\u011Fi\u015Fimi ayn\u0131
    yerde g\xF6rmeyi m\xFCmk\xFCn k\u0131lar."
  _sector: "\xC7anakkale / T\xDCRK\u0130YE"
